UfG97nWNvGKoL1tAfWp9TSw&oe=6B006E89"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot00000 4.png", "id": "28785920951102424", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593945819_28785920967769089_1791014324678186002_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HAZVUdLkTpEQ7kNvwEz-tdt&_nc_oc=Adp69HM_c8EQNzMN80CXsWFJnoJxqB4jFIMf6v62enTBQQ_Y0aDXq_8vFCIUkMAowek&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTIyYmK3mh0EUqjDSVdXwUuNIA2ZOVetxQvt7w8wBpobw&oe=6B006894"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Data Center Operation Technician", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Data Center Operation Technician is a virtual reality training application developed as an integral part of the ImmerseLearn Data Center Operation Technician Certification Program.\nThe application provides students with an immersive, interactive learning environment where they can gain practical, hands-on experience with data center operations through realistic VR simulations. Students can explore data center environments, understand critical infrastructure, perform operational procedures, and develop essential technical skills in a safe and controlled virtual setting.\nAccess Restriction: This application is exclusively intended for students enrolled in the ImmerseLearn Data Center Operation Technician Certification Program. Only enrolled students with authorized access to the program will be able to use this application for their hands-on training.\nThis application serves as the practical VR training component of the certification program.", "short_description": "Data Center Operation Technician is an immersive VR training application developed as part of the ImmerseLearn Data Center Operation Technician Certification Program. Designed exclusively for enrolled students, the application provides hands-on virtual reality training to practice essential data center operations, procedures, and technical skills in a real